<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The hourglass from the student's DueWise logo (an AI draft the student edited; see AI-USE.md),
     for the start-up screen on Android 12 and newer (values-v31/themes.xml). It is the logo kit's
     duewise-mark-reversed.svg. Since 2026-10-22, when the app became light, it has the colors of
     the kit's version for light backgrounds (pine #1F3B34, brass #B8914F); until then it had the
     colors for dark backgrounds (off-white #EEF2F0, brass). Claude Code converted it into a vector
     without changing any shape. Android
     shows a start-up icon 288 dp wide but only the round middle, 192 dp across, so the viewport
     is larger than the mark and the whole hourglass fits inside that circle. Lint's 200 dp limit
     for vector icons doesn't apply: Android asks for 288 dp here, and draws it once at start-up. -->
